          {
            "startIndex": 1,
            "endIndex": 53,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1,
                  "endIndex": 53,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Cottonworld — Added active product PDP descriptions\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "headingId": "h.6rqe8my2xkw4",
                "namedStyleType": "TITLE",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 53,
            "endIndex": 59,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 53,
                  "endIndex": 59,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Scope\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "headingId": "h.keblwqqdo708",
                "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 59,
            "endIndex": 307,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 59,
                  "endIndex": 307,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "392 product descriptions were added to the Boltworks sheet, column C, rows 2–393. They follow the earlier active-batch format: a product introduction, sourced construction and care details where available, a styling note, and the exact Product ID.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 307,
            "endIndex": 321,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 307,
                  "endIndex": 321,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Source checks\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "headingId": "h.vd9hrvwsvaye",
                "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 321,
            "endIndex": 662,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 321,
                  "endIndex": 662,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "388 descriptions use the Cottonworld product export for product identity, fabric composition, fit, pattern, garment details, and available care instructions. All 392 descriptions passed checks for repeated fabric and colour words, duplicate bodies, product IDs, gender labels, and description structure. The median body length is 115 words.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 662,
            "endIndex": 1059,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 662,
                  "endIndex": 1059,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Four rows have narrower evidence. Row 24 uses the supplied product URL for the women’s navy linen blouse and boxy fit; the source export has no matching record. Rows 293–295 use merchant variant records for the men’s cotton shirts in khaki, olive, and wine. The proposed product URLs for these four rows returned 404 during this check. Confirm the four product records before publishing the copy.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 1059,
            "endIndex": 1066,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1059,
                  "endIndex": 1066,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Review\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "headingId": "h.nk6qwusib079",
                "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 1066,
            "endIndex": 1333,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1066,
                  "endIndex": 1333,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Column C was read back against every generated description. The supplied product URLs and updated URLs in columns A and B were preserved. The description cells wrap, and the new header matches the existing header style. The rendered sheet was checked at normal zoom.\n",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                }
              ],
              "paragraphStyle": {
                "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT",
                "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT"
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "startIndex": 1333,
            "endIndex": 1357,
            "paragraph": {
              "elements": [
                {
                  "startIndex": 1333,
                  "endIndex": 1355,
                  "textRun": {
                    "content": "Updated Google Sheet: ",
                    "textStyle": {}
                  }
                },
